# Language Separation (Planning vs Implementation)

## Purpose

Separate **product/requirements communication** (with the user) from **implementation artifacts** (code, dev docs). This keeps code reviewable internationally and keeps user–agent dialogue clear in Chinese.

## Agent ↔ User (Chinese)

- Plans, summaries, questions, trade-offs, and status updates: **简体中文**
- Explain *what* and *why* to the user in Chinese
- User-facing reports and delivery notes: **简体中文**

## Internal Development Thinking (English)

- Implementation thinking during development (debug notes, technical reasoning, TODO scratch notes, design deliberation): **English**
- Keep internal engineering reasoning separate from user-facing communication language
- This applies to development-process artifacts; it does not change end-user UI language rules

## Code & Developer Documentation (English)

- Source code: identifiers, comments, commit messages (when agent writes them), log tags, error codes — **English**
- Project dev docs under `AudioStream_C++/` (e.g. `DESIGN.md`, `README.md`, inline API notes): **English**
- Do not add Chinese in `.h`, `.cpp`, `.ts` implementation files unless it is **user-facing UI string** routed through i18n (see below)

## End-User UI (i18n, Chinese default)

- User-visible strings: use an **i18n layer** (e.g. `ui/strings/` or resource files), not hardcoded in logic
- **Default locale: `zh-CN`** (install-and-use audience)
- Structure for future locales (`en-US`, etc.); logic must not branch on raw Chinese text
- Tray menus, dialogs, status lines, firewall hints: Chinese by default via locale files

## Migration

- When touching existing code with Chinese comments or dev strings, prefer converting to English in the same change if scope allows
- Do not translate user-facing product copy in old web clients unless explicitly requested

## Examples

```cpp
// ✅ GOOD — English in code
Logger::Info("Room created: " + roomCode);

// ❌ BAD — Chinese in implementation
Logger::Info("房间已创建: " + roomCode);

// ✅ GOOD — UI via i18n (default zh-CN resource)
statusText->SetText(Strings::Get(L"status.room_running"));
```

```markdown
User message: 继续开发 Phase 1
Agent reply: 简体中文说明进度与下一步
Code added: English only in .cpp / DESIGN.md
```
